# Minecraft Bedrock Local Resource Pack Manager

A legitimate local-only project for managing resource packs in a Minecraft Bedrock workflow. This project focuses on client-side visual customization only, without affecting other players or server state.

## Purpose

This tool is meant to help you:
- organize resource packs on your device
- enable or disable them locally
- keep a clean, client-only workflow for customization
- manage Bedrock visual packs without altering others' experience

## Important note

This project is intentionally local-only. It is not meant to manipulate anyone else's client, server, or gameplay state. It changes the selected resource pack set for your own game installation.

## Features

- Local pack discovery from `./resourcepacks`
- Pack metadata parsing from `pack.mcmeta`
- Toggle packs on/off in a client-side config
- Simple console-based UI for enabling/disabling packs
- Explicit “client-only” behavior designed to keep all effects local

